<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Teljoy cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Teljoy cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Teljoy Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that shareholders should continue to exercise caution when trading in its shares due to the unbundling of Servgro International.</p>
<p>The second phase of Servgro's unbundling will result in either the distribution of proceeds derived from the disposal of Servgro shares in Teljoy or the distribution of Teljoy shares to Servgro's shareholders.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
